      "text": "The net flow rate of air into a chamber is modeled by \\( W(t) = 4 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{t^{2}}{2} \\right)} - 2 \\) liters per second, where t is measured in seconds for \\( 0 \\le t \\le \\frac{7}{2} \\). Using a calculator, find the average value of W(t) over \\( 0 \\le t \\le \\frac{7}{2} \\). Show the setup for the calculation, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
